  When `k` is scalar or `k[0] == k[1]`, `M` is part of the batch size
  [I, J, ..., M], and the output tensor is:

  ```
  output[i, j, ..., l, m, n]
    = diagonal[i, j, ..., l, n-max(d_upper, 0)] ; if n - m == d_upper
